          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Large",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "text": "The under-21 handgun opinion finally has its second outlet, its primary document and a named official on the record.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "The Reload independently confirmed DOJ's Office of Legal Counsel opinion that the federal ban on dealer handgun sales to 18-to-20-year-olds is unconstitutional as applied. FPC says DOJ then sought an extension in Reese v. ATF; the opinion is non-binding and the statute is unchanged.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Small",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "color": "Warning",
            "text": "HOTTEST LEADS",
            "spacing": "Medium"
          },
