            "color": "Warning",
            "text": "WHAT'S MOVING",
            "spacing": "Medium"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Small",
            "text": "• OLC under-21 opinion confirmed by 2nd outlet; still non-binding\n• FPC: DOJ sought extension in Reese v. ATF (docket not reached)\n• Minnesota: day 1 past DOJ deadline, nothing filed\n• AR-15 cases steady at 76; T-69 to Dec 2 argument",
